            <small data-i18n="STMemoryBooks_APIProfileConfigHint">\uD83D\uDCA1 Profile Setup Hint: Configure and test connections in SillyTavern first. Custom API profiles can use the active Custom connection or bind a specific Custom connection profile above. Full Manual Configuration is only for exceptional direct-browser connections.</small>
